    {
      "text": "If you are in the market for a high grade power supply for a home or small business server and need redundancy then the FSP Twins comes highly recommended.",
      "url": "http://www.kitguru.net/components/power-supplies/zardon/fsp-twins-500w-redundant-power-supply-review/"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it comes to protecting your systems, your data and your uptime, a redundant PSU adds peace of mind. The FSP Twins is as easy to use as any ATX PSU, but helps ensure your system never goes without power.",
      "url": "https://www.eteknix.com/fsp-twins-500w-review/"
    },
    {
      "text": "FSP has now brought its Twins solution to the enthusiast market, and FSP have done it quite well.",
      "url": "https://www.hardocp.com/article/2017/02/01/fsp_twins_500w_atx_redundant_power_supply_review/"
    },
    {
      "text": "Twins is the first hybrid desktop/redundant PSU to hit the market, and it packs a great number of interesting features, including digital circuits and a communication interface with the system's mainboard, good build quality, top-notch cooling fans, and an easy-to-use software. It can't match regular high-end desktop PSUs in terms of performance,",
      "url": "https://www.techpowerup.com/reviews/TechPowerUp/Editors_Picks_2017/8.html"
    },
